  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports Working Capital and Cash Flow Optimization for an integrated oil & gas company running 20 business units across Upstream, Downstream, Midstream, and Corporate. Stakeholders include Treasury (cash position, FX, intercompany), Controllership (AR / AP / inventory), and the CFO / Treasurer (free cash flow, cash conversion cycle, net debt, dividend coverage).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Free cash flow = free_cash_flow_usd on cashflow_kpi_monthly; primary shareholder-return funding source\n- DSO = dso_days on working_capital_snapshots; IOC benchmark 30-45 days\n- DPO = dpo_days on working_capital_snapshots; typically 30-50 days for majors\n- CCC = cash_conversion_cycle_days on cashflow_kpi_monthly (DSO + DIO - DPO); lower = better\n- Current ratio = current_ratio on cashflow_kpi_monthly; target >1.0 for healthy liquidity\n- Net debt = net_debt_usd; leverage indicator vs. EBITDA\n- Inflows / outflows = amount_usd sign on cash_transactions (positive = inflow)\n- Working capital components = accounts_receivable_usd, accounts_payable_usd, inventory_usd, cash_balance_usd\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - cash_transactions_metrics (source: cash_transactions) — dims: transaction_date, business_unit_id, segment, region, flow_type, counterparty; measures: total_inflows_usd, total_outflows_usd, net_cash_flow_usd, total_transactions, avg_days_outstanding, max_amount.\n  - working_capital_snapshots_metrics (source: working_capital_snapshots) — dims: snapshot_date, business_unit_id, segment, region; measures: total_receivables_usd, total_payables_usd, total_inventory_usd, total_cash_balance_usd, avg_dso_days, total_dpo_days, max_accounts_receivable.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. business_unit_name, dso_days, dpo_days, free_cash_flow_usd, cash_conversion_cycle_days, current_ratio, net_debt_usd).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 business units by total cash inflows over the last 90 days.",
    "Show monthly free cash flow by segment for the trailing 12 months.",
    "Which business units have DSO above 45 days, and what is their accounts receivable balance?",
    "What is the trend in cash conversion cycle month-over-month across the Downstream segment?",
    "Top 10 business units by net debt — and how does that compare to their cash balance?",
    "Which business units have negative free cash flow this year, and by how much?",
    "How has total accounts payable trended month-over-month by segment?"
